WEBVTT

01:37.770 --> 01:40.610
[Fate Chooses You]

01:41.280 --> 01:43.740
[Episode 38]

02:08.360 --> 02:09.090
Senior Bai.

02:09.910 --> 02:11.110
If the heart is bound,

02:11.520 --> 02:12.960
no matter how high your realm is

02:12.960 --> 02:14.430
or how strong your power is,

02:14.430 --> 02:15.490
you won't be happy.

02:16.750 --> 02:17.880
If the heart is free,

02:18.360 --> 02:19.490
everything is free,

02:21.000 --> 02:22.400
even if your realm falls,

02:23.190 --> 02:25.050
you have no immortal perception,

02:25.400 --> 02:26.460
or you are a mortal.

02:28.120 --> 02:29.190
If the Crazy Taoist's prophecy

02:29.190 --> 02:29.800
is true

02:30.520 --> 02:32.470
that among those born on September 9th,

02:32.470 --> 02:33.870
there really is a savior,

02:34.520 --> 02:35.980
then I believe that person

02:36.240 --> 02:37.000
must be you.

03:26.800 --> 03:28.840
S-S-Senior Bai.

03:29.710 --> 03:30.680
Senior Bai.

03:31.750 --> 03:32.960
Senior Bai!

03:43.960 --> 03:45.560
Good riddance.

03:46.000 --> 03:47.560
He deserved it!

03:55.680 --> 03:57.120
Do you want to die too?

03:57.960 --> 04:00.470
I want you to die alongside Senior Bai!

04:35.430 --> 04:36.360
What happened?

04:38.680 --> 04:40.870
Someone has activated
the Mountain-Guarding Formation

04:40.870 --> 04:43.420
and isolated this place
from the outside world.

04:43.420 --> 04:45.080
Without new vitality intake,

04:45.270 --> 04:46.530
the divine Jianmu Tree

04:46.560 --> 04:47.890
can't continue to grow.

04:49.430 --> 04:50.120
I'll go.

06:11.680 --> 06:13.140
Even with so little power,

06:13.720 --> 06:14.950
you summoned me.

06:17.310 --> 06:18.240
You feel bad,

06:19.310 --> 06:20.360
and I feel bad too.

06:23.430 --> 06:24.630
I've made a decision,

06:25.270 --> 06:26.670
and I should let you know.

06:29.310 --> 06:30.710
Have you really decided?

06:32.510 --> 06:33.120
I have.

06:37.430 --> 06:38.390
Then just do it.

06:39.750 --> 06:40.409
From now on,

06:41.720 --> 06:43.180
I won't be myself anymore.

06:44.000 --> 06:45.600
And I won't have my memories.

06:46.720 --> 06:48.050
I am just a piece of wood.

06:48.510 --> 06:50.110
Because I gained your power,

06:51.430 --> 06:53.090
I'm able to walk in this world.

06:54.070 --> 06:56.200
To be able to see this beautiful world,

06:56.950 --> 06:57.950
I am very content.

06:59.270 --> 07:00.120
Thank you.

07:02.030 --> 07:04.160
Whether you have your memories or not,

07:04.510 --> 07:06.240
we will definitely meet again.

07:07.680 --> 07:08.720
I hope

07:09.800 --> 07:11.240
we will meet again in the future.

07:11.240 --> 07:12.680
And then tell me

07:14.160 --> 07:15.690
the things I've forgotten.

07:35.230 --> 07:36.960
You finally came back.

07:38.190 --> 07:39.240
I knew it.

07:40.050 --> 07:40.970
No one

07:41.159 --> 07:43.680
can resist supreme power.

07:45.020 --> 07:45.900
Now,

07:46.390 --> 07:48.240
what did you come for?

07:50.430 --> 07:51.560
I need power.

07:53.560 --> 07:54.430
Is that so?

07:54.870 --> 07:55.680
That's not what you said

07:55.680 --> 07:57.240
last time.

07:58.070 --> 07:58.920
You said

07:59.250 --> 08:01.420
you wanted to see the color of the sky,

08:01.720 --> 08:03.830
taste delicious food,

08:04.430 --> 08:05.920
sleep peacefully,

08:06.160 --> 08:07.830
feel pain,

08:08.480 --> 08:10.270
and like ordinary people,

08:10.480 --> 08:12.070
go through the cycle of life and death,

08:12.070 --> 08:14.480
living a peaceful and stable life.

08:15.120 --> 08:15.720
Why?

08:16.160 --> 08:17.390
Do you regret it?

08:18.120 --> 08:20.190
Had enough of an ordinary life?

08:21.560 --> 08:22.390
Then,

08:22.750 --> 08:24.750
what do you want now?

08:25.660 --> 08:26.860
Supreme power?

08:27.240 --> 08:28.600
Highest status?

08:28.870 --> 08:29.950
Or do you want,

08:30.270 --> 08:32.110
like your ancestors,

08:32.470 --> 08:33.880
to use absolute power

08:34.000 --> 08:35.799
to reign above all living things

08:36.080 --> 08:38.120
and become the master of this world?

08:38.630 --> 08:40.030
I can help you with that.

08:41.080 --> 08:41.720
No.

08:44.120 --> 08:45.000
No?

08:46.210 --> 08:47.340
I have gotten my wish

08:47.510 --> 08:49.040
and lived an ordinary life.

08:50.080 --> 08:50.960
I've seen

08:50.960 --> 08:51.910
the blue sky

08:52.910 --> 08:53.910
and the most beautiful colors

08:53.910 --> 08:55.000
in the world.

08:56.120 --> 08:57.780
I have tasted delicious food,

08:58.390 --> 08:59.650
can sleep peacefully,

09:00.750 --> 09:02.080
and have had happiness.

09:02.200 --> 09:02.960
From now on,

09:03.630 --> 09:05.080
how should I address you?

09:05.870 --> 09:06.840
I can't call you Lord Lu

09:06.840 --> 09:08.630
or Mr. Lu anymore.

09:09.390 --> 09:10.190
So from now on,

09:10.670 --> 09:11.730
I'll call you this.

09:12.550 --> 09:13.270
Qianqiao.

09:14.840 --> 09:15.510
Qianqiao.

09:17.150 --> 09:19.350
Your cultivation was stagnant before,

09:19.440 --> 09:20.270
so you wanted to

09:20.270 --> 09:21.730
live in Wei County with me.

09:21.840 --> 09:22.700
Now that you are

09:22.870 --> 09:24.440
a Nascent Soul cultivator,

09:24.910 --> 09:26.240
have you changed your mind?

09:26.240 --> 09:26.720
No.

09:27.440 --> 09:29.270
I still want to live
in Wei County with you.

09:29.270 --> 09:30.360
When the time comes,

09:30.360 --> 09:31.560
we will open a clinic.

09:31.600 --> 09:32.850
You treat patients and save people,

09:32.850 --> 09:33.670
and I'll help you

09:33.670 --> 09:34.550
from the side.

09:35.270 --> 09:36.400
Didn't you say that,

09:37.240 --> 09:38.320
after finishing the fate

09:38.320 --> 09:39.480
of Curse of Five Deficiencies,

09:39.480 --> 09:41.080
you could drink the best wine

09:41.510 --> 09:43.310
and have the most delicious food

09:43.440 --> 09:45.770
in the biggest restaurant in the capital?

09:46.130 --> 09:46.660
Although

09:46.670 --> 09:48.440
it's not completely over yet,

09:49.000 --> 09:50.480
today is your birthday.

09:51.200 --> 09:52.730
So I prepared this on my own.

09:54.510 --> 09:55.150
May you

09:55.360 --> 09:56.890
be like flowers and leaves,

09:57.000 --> 09:57.930
year after year,

09:58.600 --> 10:00.130
sharing the spring breeze.

10:00.840 --> 10:02.960
Forever cherish the joy
of spring with a smile,

10:02.960 --> 10:06.160
and dwell in the world
as a timeless, longevity immortal.

10:09.000 --> 10:10.870
I also have a lover, friends,

10:11.120 --> 10:11.780
and family.

10:12.360 --> 10:13.200
I almost live

10:13.200 --> 10:15.330
the stable life of an ordinary person.

10:16.360 --> 10:17.490
I am very satisfied.

10:18.630 --> 10:19.630
The person I am now

10:20.360 --> 10:21.690
wants to protect it all.

10:22.320 --> 10:23.550
Protect?

10:24.630 --> 10:25.630
I am in trouble.

10:26.630 --> 10:27.840
I need great power

10:28.030 --> 10:29.290
to protect all of this.

10:30.200 --> 10:31.530
You have to understand.

10:32.000 --> 10:34.080
To become a Perfect War Demon,

10:34.440 --> 10:37.030
you have to sacrifice all your memories.

10:37.800 --> 10:39.680
The good or the bad ones.

10:40.200 --> 10:41.930
The tender or the painful ones.

10:42.440 --> 10:44.700
You will become a completely new person.

10:45.000 --> 10:46.400
You will no longer be you.

10:48.240 --> 10:48.840
A person

10:49.390 --> 10:50.960
is shaped

10:50.960 --> 10:52.440
by past experiences.

10:52.910 --> 10:54.240
Losing your memory

10:54.460 --> 10:55.670
means the original you

10:55.670 --> 10:58.080
has completely disappeared.

10:59.320 --> 11:01.380
You will no longer love your beloved,

11:01.550 --> 11:03.720
nor cherish all of this anymore.

11:03.750 --> 11:05.350
Even if my memories are gone,

11:06.240 --> 11:07.440
even if I am gone,

11:07.960 --> 11:09.390
as long as this heart is here,

11:09.390 --> 11:10.590
everything remains.

11:11.790 --> 11:13.390
Like a dead pine tree,

11:14.510 --> 11:16.640
no matter how many new shoots it grows,

11:16.670 --> 11:18.530
it can never become a poplar tree.

11:18.870 --> 11:19.550
I believe

11:20.320 --> 11:22.050
a Perfect War Demon with power,

11:22.120 --> 11:23.650
even without all memories,

11:24.320 --> 11:25.320
will still do

11:25.320 --> 11:26.250
the right thing.

11:38.150 --> 11:40.200
You and your ancestors

11:40.630 --> 11:41.960
are not the same.

11:43.550 --> 11:46.750
I hope you succeed.

11:47.510 --> 11:48.120
Thank you.

11:51.790 --> 11:54.050
After my Ghost Covering Eyes was lifted,

11:54.510 --> 11:56.310
I suddenly realized something.

11:56.840 --> 11:57.480
What is it?

11:59.080 --> 12:00.030
I realized

12:00.510 --> 12:01.790
I like you even more.

12:05.440 --> 12:06.510
If one day,

12:07.480 --> 12:09.670
you are also hit by Ghost Covering Eyes,

12:09.670 --> 12:10.320
will you forget me

12:10.320 --> 12:11.240
completely

12:11.390 --> 12:12.850
and not remember me at all?

12:13.270 --> 12:14.530
How could that happen?

12:15.120 --> 12:16.000
What if?

12:44.550 --> 12:45.150
Sheng.

12:47.720 --> 12:48.870
I am not her.

12:57.080 --> 12:58.200
Void Stage.

12:58.870 --> 13:00.120
Your realm improved

13:00.120 --> 13:01.360
quite fast.

13:02.670 --> 13:03.240
Yes.

13:03.750 --> 13:05.350
Otherwise, how can I kill you

13:05.720 --> 13:06.840
to avenge Sheng?

13:09.120 --> 13:11.000
I am inside her body now.

13:11.720 --> 13:12.790
Killing me

13:13.390 --> 13:14.510
means killing her.

13:15.510 --> 13:17.440
Aren't you two as close as sisters?

13:17.840 --> 13:18.970
Can you bear to do it?

13:19.550 --> 13:20.320
Come on.

13:21.870 --> 13:22.960
Get out of her body.

13:25.600 --> 13:26.680
Childish.

13:27.150 --> 13:28.210
Get out of her body!

14:20.080 --> 14:21.200
Junior Jiang!

14:28.360 --> 14:29.390
Kill him!

14:54.080 --> 14:55.870
Junior Jiang!

15:31.120 --> 15:32.360
Fighting with me,

15:32.630 --> 15:34.360
yet you dare to be distracted?

16:03.870 --> 16:05.360
What should we do?

16:06.120 --> 16:08.320
You have the strength of the Void Stage,

16:08.550 --> 16:11.150
but you can only
be beaten with your hands tied.

16:11.670 --> 16:13.070
Aren't you doomed to die?

16:15.870 --> 16:17.200
What's with that look?

16:18.150 --> 16:19.880
You are Sheng's Senior Sister.

16:20.150 --> 16:22.270
Logically, you should call me Aunt.

16:22.910 --> 16:24.080
How can you be so disrespectful

16:24.080 --> 16:25.910
when seeing an elder?

16:27.080 --> 16:28.880
You don't deserve to be an elder.

16:29.120 --> 16:30.180
Worse than beasts,

16:30.550 --> 16:31.870
you bring ruin to your descendants.

16:31.870 --> 16:33.800
She was originally very obedient.

16:34.510 --> 16:37.150
I guess she must have picked up
bad habits from you.

16:37.150 --> 16:39.320
How should I punish you?

16:47.360 --> 16:48.080
Sheng.

16:49.120 --> 16:50.000
Sheng.

16:58.390 --> 16:59.790
This rebellious child.

17:00.150 --> 17:01.950
You actually dared to resist me.

17:02.440 --> 17:03.930
Do you think hiding in the spiritual sea

17:03.930 --> 17:05.730
means I can't do anything to you?

17:12.720 --> 17:13.400
Sheng.

17:19.690 --> 17:21.440
Three to the left, 7 to the right;
9 upon the crown, 1 beneath the feet.

17:21.440 --> 17:23.109
Two and 4 as shoulders, 6 and 8 as limbs.

17:23.109 --> 17:26.040
Five abides in the central palace,
filling its core.

17:26.310 --> 17:27.369
Enter meditation.

17:41.270 --> 17:41.880
Sheng?

17:43.240 --> 17:43.830
Sheng?

17:45.160 --> 17:45.830
Sheng?

17:47.720 --> 17:48.310
Sheng?

17:50.240 --> 17:50.880
Sheng?

17:52.920 --> 17:53.550
Sheng?

17:54.400 --> 17:54.960
Senior!

18:04.730 --> 18:07.130
[Sheng's Spiritual Sea]

18:05.310 --> 18:05.880
Sheng?

18:08.000 --> 18:08.550
Sheng?

18:10.400 --> 18:10.920
Sheng?

18:14.550 --> 18:15.070
Sheng.

18:19.550 --> 18:20.240
Senior.

18:21.200 --> 18:22.130
Are you alright?

18:24.830 --> 18:25.680
I'm fine.

18:38.950 --> 18:39.750
He didn't die.

18:40.200 --> 18:40.920
He turned into a blood crow,

18:40.920 --> 18:42.160
hid inside me,

18:42.510 --> 18:43.840
and controlled my body.

18:44.880 --> 18:46.480
The one who attacked you earlier

18:46.480 --> 18:47.210
was also him.

18:47.830 --> 18:48.510
I know.

18:50.240 --> 18:52.030
So what if you know?

18:52.680 --> 18:53.610
I want your life!

19:09.750 --> 19:10.400
Xin Mei.

19:11.510 --> 19:12.030
Sheng.

19:19.000 --> 19:19.640
Old cur,

19:19.920 --> 19:20.400
die!

19:34.920 --> 19:36.320
Great Completion Stage.

19:37.460 --> 19:38.040
The thing Li Mofu works on

19:38.040 --> 19:39.590
is not bad.

19:40.680 --> 19:43.310
Using a cultivator's
immortal perception as a tonic

19:43.310 --> 19:44.570
is such a great method.

19:45.070 --> 19:47.000
Why didn't I think of this before?

19:50.680 --> 19:51.440
Sheng,

19:52.550 --> 19:54.270
you really are my good child.

19:55.000 --> 19:56.200
I originally thought

19:56.320 --> 19:57.680
that giving birth to a baby girl back then

19:57.680 --> 19:59.310
was due to my powers failing.

20:00.640 --> 20:02.110
Until I entered your body,

20:02.110 --> 20:03.070
did I realize

20:04.310 --> 20:06.000
that you are just like me,

20:06.680 --> 20:08.940
both born with an innate spiritual body.

20:10.880 --> 20:11.440
Good.

20:11.460 --> 20:12.550
This is very good.

20:16.030 --> 20:18.230
Crazy Taoist's calculation was right.

20:18.750 --> 20:20.440
I indeed have an offspring

20:20.440 --> 20:21.900
who can ascend to godhood.

20:22.000 --> 20:22.860
And that person

20:23.200 --> 20:24.240
is you.

20:26.270 --> 20:27.200
It's a pity

20:27.400 --> 20:30.160
that your immortal destiny
has been intercepted by me.

20:30.160 --> 20:31.880
I will take over your body,

20:32.470 --> 20:33.830
seek the great Dao,

20:33.960 --> 20:35.290
and become an immortal.

20:35.450 --> 20:37.030
I will live as long as the heavens

20:37.030 --> 20:38.310
and shine like the sun.

20:39.720 --> 20:40.720
An animal like you

20:40.720 --> 20:42.250
wants to ascend to godhood?

20:42.270 --> 20:43.130
In your dreams!

20:44.440 --> 20:45.700
You don't understand.

20:46.240 --> 20:47.160
Do you think all gods

20:47.160 --> 20:48.920
are just and holy?

20:50.200 --> 20:51.060
Don't be silly.

20:51.830 --> 20:53.480
The only difference
between gods and humans

20:53.480 --> 20:54.110
is simply

20:54.110 --> 20:55.960
the level of their power.

20:57.160 --> 20:57.960
Sheng,

20:58.550 --> 21:00.280
actually, we are no different.

21:00.880 --> 21:01.790
I am different!

21:02.640 --> 21:03.550
I am different.

21:04.030 --> 21:04.480
Sheng.

21:04.480 --> 21:05.340
I am different.

21:05.510 --> 21:06.750
There's no use talking to him.

21:06.750 --> 21:07.810
You are different.

21:09.480 --> 21:10.400
I am different.

21:10.750 --> 21:11.270
Right.

21:11.920 --> 21:12.980
You are different.

21:15.640 --> 21:16.350
Do you remember the poem

21:16.350 --> 21:17.400
Master told us?

21:20.200 --> 21:21.930
"All things must come to an end—

21:22.500 --> 21:24.830
only when the sun sets
does the moon rise."

21:25.350 --> 21:27.150
"As I descend the mountain path,

21:27.270 --> 21:28.920
others will still rise to climb it."

21:28.920 --> 21:29.480
Right.

21:30.680 --> 21:32.240
Let's send him down!

21:33.680 --> 21:34.400
Okay.

22:09.750 --> 22:10.510
Sheng!

22:23.070 --> 22:23.880
Senior,

22:24.240 --> 22:25.000
get out!

22:27.510 --> 22:28.270
Sheng!

22:30.640 --> 22:31.640
Sheng!

22:41.720 --> 22:42.400
Sheng.

22:42.790 --> 22:43.400
Sheng!

22:45.070 --> 22:45.790
Senior,

22:46.110 --> 22:46.680
hurry.

22:47.070 --> 22:47.920
Kill me.

22:52.030 --> 22:53.550
I'm losing control of him.

22:53.920 --> 22:54.720
If he gets out,

22:54.750 --> 22:55.830
we'll all die!

22:56.110 --> 22:56.830
Sheng.

23:01.000 --> 23:01.590
No.

23:01.920 --> 23:03.640
Senior, hurry!

23:04.110 --> 23:04.830
No.

23:05.350 --> 23:06.110
No way.

23:08.590 --> 23:09.640
Lord of Rust-Sword,

23:09.640 --> 23:10.270
is your sword

23:10.270 --> 23:12.590
just scrap iron for chopping vegetables?

23:12.590 --> 23:14.000
Do it! Kill me!

23:22.390 --> 23:23.340
I'm sorry.

23:32.430 --> 23:33.240
Senior,

23:33.550 --> 23:34.310
do it.

23:34.830 --> 23:36.360
I can't hold on much longer.

23:39.000 --> 23:39.750
Senior,

23:40.510 --> 23:41.350
do it.

23:55.270 --> 23:57.550
Do it. Do it.

23:59.880 --> 24:01.550
Do it, Senior!

24:21.790 --> 24:22.400
Sheng.

24:28.640 --> 24:30.240
Sheng! Sheng!

24:30.910 --> 24:31.540
Sheng.

24:31.960 --> 24:32.550
Sheng.

24:33.110 --> 24:33.830
Sheng.

24:36.680 --> 24:37.720
Senior,

24:38.480 --> 24:39.350
don't cry.

24:39.370 --> 24:39.890
Sheng.

24:39.920 --> 24:40.890
Don't cry.

24:40.920 --> 24:41.920
What should we do?

24:42.880 --> 24:43.880
How can I save you?

24:44.350 --> 24:45.680
What can I do to save you?

24:46.240 --> 24:46.830
Sheng,

24:47.240 --> 24:48.750
I can't save you.

24:48.920 --> 24:50.000
Sheng.

24:51.960 --> 24:53.680
You should be happy for me.

24:54.590 --> 24:56.200
I have avenged myself.

24:57.240 --> 24:59.310
Xia Xuanzi is finally dead.

25:00.400 --> 25:02.130
I have no regrets.

25:03.400 --> 25:05.120
Sheng, don't say that.

25:05.720 --> 25:06.960
Don't say that.

25:08.400 --> 25:09.310
Senior.

25:11.440 --> 25:13.770
I didn't believe in ghosts or gods before,

25:14.160 --> 25:15.790
but after I met you,

25:16.400 --> 25:18.000
I started to believe.

25:19.310 --> 25:20.440
I always feel

25:21.200 --> 25:22.160
that if there are truly gods

25:22.160 --> 25:23.830
in this world,

25:25.400 --> 25:26.350
they must be

25:26.350 --> 25:28.070
just like you, Senior.

25:34.510 --> 25:35.270
Sheng.

25:36.790 --> 25:37.520
Don't sleep.

25:38.400 --> 25:39.530
I will take you home.

25:40.400 --> 25:42.060
Let's go back to Xin Xie Manor.

25:42.350 --> 25:43.160
Let's go home,

25:43.350 --> 25:44.000
okay?

25:44.830 --> 25:45.510
Sheng.

25:46.790 --> 25:47.720
Don't cry.

25:48.960 --> 25:50.920
Don't cry, Senior.

25:52.550 --> 25:53.480
Senior.

25:55.590 --> 25:56.640
I really,

25:58.240 --> 26:00.240
really can't bear to leave you.

26:03.590 --> 26:05.830
I hope you will be happy.

26:18.240 --> 26:18.960
Sheng.

26:19.930 --> 26:23.240
♪ Hear the Gu curse
turn into cries for help ♪

26:23.300 --> 26:27.210
♪ Blood-stained hand, sword drawn ♪

26:23.510 --> 26:24.310
Sheng.

26:27.230 --> 26:30.710
♪ Trapped in Qianyan Cave ♪

26:28.200 --> 26:29.550
Sheng!

26:30.640 --> 26:32.640
Sheng! Sheng!

26:30.730 --> 26:34.210
♪ Even hell must be broken free from ♪

26:35.340 --> 26:38.510
♪ With every stroke of hatred ♪

26:36.070 --> 26:38.350
Sheng! Sheng!

26:38.540 --> 26:42.550
♪ Let it grow into a dagger I wear ♪

26:42.580 --> 26:44.820
♪ No need to show me mercy there ♪

26:44.840 --> 26:48.680
♪ Let me take every blow ♪

26:50.300 --> 26:54.400
♪ Drag my wounds through the hollow road ♪

26:54.420 --> 26:57.700
♪ I'll pluck the passion
locked in my brow ♪

26:57.730 --> 27:01.090
♪ At the end of the mountains,
I pick up fireflies now ♪

27:00.350 --> 27:01.590
Sheng!

27:01.120 --> 27:05.270
♪ Burn me down, I feel no pain ♪

27:03.350 --> 27:04.790
No!

27:05.310 --> 27:06.890
♪ I believe Heaven sees all ♪\

27:06.920 --> 27:09.180
♪ Its wrath shines upon demons ♪

27:09.360 --> 27:12.740
♪ But who will show me mercy? ♪

27:12.770 --> 27:14.290
♪ I believe I'm innocent ♪

27:14.310 --> 27:19.620
♪ Turned into dust and scattered away ♪

27:20.360 --> 27:21.940
♪ I accept the blame of
numerous accusations ♪

27:21.970 --> 27:24.430
♪ I offer no defense ♪

27:24.660 --> 27:27.560
♪ To protect what I believe is worth it ♪

27:27.740 --> 27:29.380
♪ I admit my heart
is as hard as iron and stone ♪

27:29.410 --> 27:32.220
♪ Call me cold if you must ♪

27:32.250 --> 27:35.250
♪ I'll risk it all ♪

27:36.960 --> 27:37.550
Senior,

27:38.480 --> 27:40.070
I don't want to ascend to the sky,

27:40.070 --> 27:41.730
nor do I want to be an immortal.

27:48.270 --> 27:50.200
I just want to stay in Xin Xie Manor.

27:51.480 --> 27:52.810
Do you like Lu Qianqiao?

27:53.750 --> 27:55.310
If you like him, then so be it.

27:55.310 --> 27:56.640
I didn't like him before

27:56.750 --> 27:58.610
because his power was too strong,

27:58.640 --> 28:00.270
and I was afraid you'd get hurt.

28:00.270 --> 28:01.790
Now he is just

28:01.790 --> 28:02.790
a Foundation Establishment cultivator,

28:02.790 --> 28:04.390
and he will continue to fall.

28:04.440 --> 28:05.700
He can't beat me at all.

28:06.110 --> 28:07.270
If he fails you,

28:07.640 --> 28:09.240
I will kill him with my sword.

28:10.200 --> 28:10.920
Senior.

28:11.680 --> 28:13.340
Let's go back to Xin Xie Manor.

28:13.480 --> 28:14.640
I want to go home.

28:15.720 --> 28:17.590
The fish we raised in the pond last year

28:17.590 --> 28:18.850
should be plump by now.

28:19.830 --> 28:21.560
I want to eat your grilled fish.

28:22.160 --> 28:24.160
Let's go back to Xin Xie Manor, okay?

28:45.070 --> 28:46.130
You want to die too?

28:46.310 --> 28:47.160
Death?

28:48.310 --> 28:49.590
Why fear death?

28:50.550 --> 28:51.480
In this battle,

28:52.680 --> 28:54.280
haven't enough people died?

28:55.350 --> 28:56.000
Master,

28:56.640 --> 28:57.350
Junior,

28:58.440 --> 28:59.500
fellow disciples,

28:59.790 --> 29:01.030
and innocent people

29:02.070 --> 29:04.000
all died because of your ambition.

29:05.240 --> 29:06.900
You've harmed so many people.

29:07.400 --> 29:09.110
Shouldn't the one who deserves death

29:09.110 --> 29:10.070
the most be you?

29:21.510 --> 29:23.160
Your master
was a Great Completion cultivator.

29:23.160 --> 29:24.310
Even he couldn't beat me.

29:24.310 --> 29:25.240
Can you?

29:25.440 --> 29:27.310
Even if I can't, I must fight!

29:46.240 --> 29:47.500
How could this happen?

30:11.960 --> 30:13.090
Lord of Rust-Sword,

30:13.550 --> 30:14.550
do you remember what your master

30:14.550 --> 30:15.640
told you?

30:16.110 --> 30:16.920
In your life,

30:17.550 --> 30:19.010
you must travel 60,000 li,

30:19.270 --> 30:21.930
raise your sword against enemies
99,000 times,

30:22.030 --> 30:24.160
-and draw blood 36,000 times
-And draw blood 36,000 times

30:24.160 --> 30:25.960
-before the rust fades
-Before the rust fades

30:25.960 --> 30:29.690
-and the divine light reappears!
-And the divine light reappears!

31:20.590 --> 31:21.320
I succeeded.

31:22.000 --> 31:22.730
I succeeded.

31:23.000 --> 31:23.730
I succeeded!

32:47.350 --> 32:48.160
Had I known you would

32:48.160 --> 32:49.420
cause such a disaster,

32:50.240 --> 32:51.240
I shouldn't have let you

32:51.240 --> 32:52.770
leave Tianyuan Sect alive.

32:56.720 --> 32:58.580
Can a person whose sword is broken

32:58.790 --> 32:59.750
still fight?

33:01.880 --> 33:04.010
A person with a broken sword can fight,

33:04.640 --> 33:06.920
but a person with a broken heart
can hardly win.

33:06.920 --> 33:07.830
Sect Master,

33:08.830 --> 33:10.160
you want to become a god,

33:10.840 --> 33:12.790
but do you know what a god is?

33:17.200 --> 33:18.400
Hou Yi shot down 9 suns

33:18.680 --> 33:20.680
to relieve the people from drought.

33:21.350 --> 33:22.400
Kuafu perished,

33:23.330 --> 33:25.120
but his body turned into the world

33:25.120 --> 33:26.650
to bless all living beings.

33:27.110 --> 33:28.110
They were humans.

33:29.270 --> 33:30.400
They were fearless,

33:30.440 --> 33:31.170
courageous,

33:31.640 --> 33:32.960
and righteous,

33:33.940 --> 33:35.860
honored as gods by the world.

33:38.350 --> 33:39.480
But what about you?

33:40.310 --> 33:41.720
You are selfish,

33:42.400 --> 33:43.800
sinister, and ruthless.

33:44.440 --> 33:46.100
You have no regard for the weak

33:46.920 --> 33:48.380
and no care for the people.

33:49.680 --> 33:50.680
With such a heart,

33:51.560 --> 33:53.200
do you deserve to become a god?

33:53.200 --> 33:53.790
Shut up!

33:55.070 --> 33:56.160
Why are all of you

33:56.160 --> 33:57.440
so annoying?

33:57.790 --> 33:59.310
First Bai, and now you.

33:59.920 --> 34:00.790
You always talk to me about

34:00.790 --> 34:02.750
the so-called morality
of the common people.

34:02.750 --> 34:03.440
Do you know

34:03.440 --> 34:04.770
how ridiculous the path

34:04.960 --> 34:05.960
you insist on is?

34:08.550 --> 34:09.670
Do you really think

34:10.760 --> 34:13.100
it's because the heavenly ladder
is severed

34:13.100 --> 34:14.960
that you can't ascend to godhood?

34:16.210 --> 34:17.460
Have you ever thought

34:18.440 --> 34:19.969
that if the heavenly ladder

34:20.630 --> 34:22.230
and deities were still here,

34:23.370 --> 34:26.190
they would only strike you
with heavenly lightning,

34:26.190 --> 34:27.790
burn you with heavenly fire,

34:28.070 --> 34:30.030
completely destroy your soul,

34:31.400 --> 34:33.530
and condemn you to eternal damnation?

34:49.840 --> 34:50.710
Fine.

34:51.810 --> 34:54.190
You had a chance to live,
yet you refused it.

34:54.190 --> 34:55.790
Since you're so eager to die,

34:56.480 --> 34:57.680
I'll grant your wish.

35:28.760 --> 35:31.970
♪ With tear-filled eyes,
we face the desolate wilds ♪

35:32.000 --> 35:34.660
♪ A thousand piles of withered bones ♪

35:34.900 --> 35:37.650
♪ The lowly, in mortal flesh,
march first ♪

35:37.670 --> 35:40.220
♪ All offered up in sacrifice ♪

35:41.150 --> 35:44.330
♪ To build the stairway to the heavens ♪

35:44.870 --> 35:47.310
♪ Forging an undying obsession ♪

35:47.980 --> 35:52.590
♪ The blade is stained with blood,
and with countless tears ♪

35:53.550 --> 35:56.190
♪ Sparks boil over,
and demons run rampant ♪

35:54.480 --> 35:55.280
Lu Qianqiao.

35:56.500 --> 35:58.500
♪ Heaven and earth
are destroyed together ♪

35:59.450 --> 36:01.030
♪ Deeply knowing that the common people ♪

36:01.100 --> 36:04.790
♪ Are an untouchable weakness ♪

36:05.760 --> 36:09.130
♪ Do not turn back
to the pain of the past ♪

36:09.450 --> 36:12.210
♪ Mindless killing must not be done ♪

36:10.320 --> 36:11.150
Lu Qianqiao!

36:12.510 --> 36:17.430
♪ With a clear conscience, a grand spirit
overpowers the majesty of heaven ♪

36:22.490 --> 36:23.340
You are a god?

36:27.320 --> 36:29.780
You've actually
become a Perfect War Demon.

36:30.550 --> 36:31.880
What are you going to do?

36:32.230 --> 36:33.360
I'm here to kill you.

36:38.030 --> 36:40.280
♪ I ask the Nine Heavens:
what is the purpose of this life? ♪

36:40.310 --> 36:43.100
♪ With my spine as my monument,
I shall never kneel ♪

36:44.070 --> 36:46.170
♪ Though this life be wretched,
I will not sink so low ♪

36:46.190 --> 36:49.010
♪ As to become a puppet of fate ♪

37:00.710 --> 37:01.440
See?

37:02.110 --> 37:03.550
This is the power of a god.

37:02.880 --> 37:05.520
♪ Sparks boil over,
and demons run rampant ♪

37:05.190 --> 37:06.000
Since you have

37:05.830 --> 37:07.830
♪ Heaven and earth
are destroyed together ♪

37:06.000 --> 37:07.530
become a Perfect War Demon,

37:08.000 --> 37:09.630
you should rebuild the heavenly ladder

37:08.780 --> 37:10.360
♪ Deeply knowing that the common people ♪

37:09.670 --> 37:10.710
and reach the Heavenly Gate with me.

37:10.430 --> 37:14.120
♪ Are an untouchable weakness ♪

37:11.150 --> 37:12.480
The shame of the Perfect War Demon

37:12.480 --> 37:13.760
has not been washed away.

37:13.760 --> 37:15.090
And the curse of the Perfect War Demon

37:15.090 --> 37:18.470
♪ Do not turn back
to the pain of the past ♪

37:15.110 --> 37:16.640
has not been broken either.

37:17.280 --> 37:19.550
You... you should go up to the heavens.

37:18.780 --> 37:21.540
♪ Mindless killing must not be done ♪

37:20.030 --> 37:21.440
Your future should be in the divine realm.

37:21.440 --> 37:23.590
You shouldn't waste your life
in the mortal realm.

37:21.840 --> 37:26.760
♪ With a clear conscience, a grand spirit
overpowers the majesty of heaven ♪

37:23.880 --> 37:25.340
Are those your last words?

37:27.360 --> 37:29.610
♪ I ask the Nine Heavens:
what is the purpose of this life? ♪

37:29.640 --> 37:32.430
♪ With my spine as my monument,
I shall never kneel ♪

37:33.400 --> 37:35.500
♪ Though this life be wretched,
I will not sink so low ♪

37:35.520 --> 37:38.340
♪ As to become a puppet of fate ♪

37:39.470 --> 37:41.820
♪ What is the purpose of life?
To draw my blade and slay evil ♪

37:41.850 --> 37:45.070
♪ Even if I am turned to dust,
I will not regret ♪

37:45.800 --> 37:46.960
Then die.

37:45.990 --> 37:47.990
♪ By my will,
I shall bring back the sun and moon ♪

37:48.060 --> 37:51.010
♪ And restore clear radiance
to the mortal realm ♪

37:51.770 --> 37:55.130
♪ Rather than bowing my back
to apologize to the Heavens ♪

37:55.370 --> 37:58.120
♪ I would sooner rewrite
this fated calamity ♪

37:58.300 --> 38:00.830
♪ I demand the story
follow my own desire ♪

38:01.050 --> 38:03.640
♪ To serve as its final conclusion ♪

38:04.200 --> 38:06.440
♪ I ask the Nine Heavens:
what is the purpose of this life? ♪

38:06.480 --> 38:09.270
♪ With my spine as my monument,
I shall never kneel ♪

38:10.230 --> 38:12.330
♪ Though this life be wretched,
I will not sink so low ♪

38:12.360 --> 38:15.180
♪ As to become a puppet of fate ♪

38:16.310 --> 38:18.660
♪ What is the purpose of life?
To draw my blade and slay evil ♪

38:18.680 --> 38:21.910
♪ Even if I am turned to dust,
I will not regret ♪

38:22.830 --> 38:24.830
♪ By my will,
I shall bring back the sun and moon ♪

38:24.890 --> 38:27.840
♪ And restore clear radiance
to the mortal realm ♪

38:28.650 --> 38:32.010
♪ Rather than bowing my back
to apologize to the Heavens ♪

38:32.210 --> 38:34.950
♪ I would sooner rewrite
this fated calamity ♪

38:35.140 --> 38:37.660
♪ I demand the story
follow my own desire ♪

38:37.880 --> 38:40.480
♪ To serve as its final conclusion ♪

38:54.030 --> 38:54.650
So,

38:55.070 --> 38:56.730
to become a Perfect War Demon,

38:56.960 --> 38:58.290
one has to pay the price.

38:59.110 --> 38:59.910
That's right.

39:00.480 --> 39:01.540
A Perfect War Demon

39:01.590 --> 39:03.780
needs to sacrifice all their memories.

39:03.780 --> 39:04.840
From then on,

39:05.070 --> 39:06.330
everything in the past

39:06.550 --> 39:08.280
will vanish like smoke.

39:09.150 --> 39:10.320
Those cherished

39:10.550 --> 39:12.280
and precious people and things

39:12.480 --> 39:14.150
will all be erased

39:14.320 --> 39:15.920
and never be recalled again.

39:17.590 --> 39:19.110
In other words,

39:19.590 --> 39:20.650
a Perfect War Demon

39:21.760 --> 39:23.440
is a completely new person,

39:24.320 --> 39:24.960
a person

39:25.880 --> 39:27.150
with no past.

39:28.280 --> 39:32.210
♪ Honor and disgrace;
rumors and prejudice ♪

39:31.800 --> 39:32.320
No.

39:33.010 --> 39:36.410
♪ Everyone has their own take ♪

39:37.040 --> 39:40.870
♪ Fingers coated in blood
and disasters brought about ♪

39:40.890 --> 39:44.130
♪ Were never what I wanted ♪

39:43.660 --> 39:44.580
Lu Qianqiao.

39:44.420 --> 39:48.260
♪ The great way is fading away,
besieged by mysterious traps ♪

39:46.710 --> 39:47.760
Lu Qianqiao!

39:49.120 --> 39:52.880
♪ Who dares to treat life and death
as nothing? ♪

39:52.900 --> 39:56.620
♪ In the blink of an eye, the body
collapses, and the soul is destroyed ♪

39:56.650 --> 40:01.620
♪ The fire starts raging across the land ♪

39:56.880 --> 39:57.880
Lu Qianqiao!

40:02.400 --> 40:04.440
♪ What do you think is ♪

40:04.460 --> 40:06.750
♪ The most impressive farewell
in the world? ♪

40:07.110 --> 40:10.250
♪ The endless slaughter and massacres ♪

40:07.480 --> 40:08.440
Lu Qianqiao!

40:11.080 --> 40:15.040
♪ Do not wait until that thin snow
on the eaves ♪

40:15.060 --> 40:18.290
♪ Turns a young man's hair white
before you regret it ♪

40:15.070 --> 40:16.880
Lu Qianqiao!

40:18.840 --> 40:20.580
♪ When do you think ♪

40:20.600 --> 40:23.040
♪ The bloody strife will come to an end? ♪

40:23.060 --> 40:26.380
♪ Burn myself to prove it
without looking back ♪

40:26.930 --> 40:30.910
♪ Holding the morning glow in hand,
I paint the world ♪

40:29.230 --> 40:30.480
Lu Qianqiao!

40:30.940 --> 40:37.120
♪ The dawn light
illuminates the vast sky ♪

40:36.150 --> 40:37.190
Lu Qianqiao!

40:37.440 --> 40:38.440
Don't go!

40:38.670 --> 40:40.800
I'm Xin Mei! Come back!

40:42.190 --> 40:44.110
Lu Qianqiao!
